        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala, Noa, Hogla, Milka na Tirza walikuwa binti zake Selofehadi. Naye Selofehadi alikuwa mwana wa Heferi, mwana wa Gileadi, mwana wa Makiri, mwana wa Manase mwanawe Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, hao binti wanne walimwendea Mose, wakasimama mbele yake na kuhani Eleazari na viongozi wote wa jumuiya ya Waisraeli, kwenye mlango wa hema la mkutano, wakasema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Baba yetu alifia jangwani nyikani na bila mtoto yeyote wa kiume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye hakuwa miongoni mwa wafuasi wa Kora waliokusanyika dhidi ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, bali alikufa kutokana na dhambi yake mwenyewe. Kwa nini basi jina la baba yetu lifutwe katika ukoo wake kwa sababu hakuwa na mtoto wa kiume? Tupe urithi pamoja na ndugu zake baba yetu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose akaleta lalamiko lao mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Hes 36:2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Wanachosema binti za Selofehadi ni kweli; wape urithi pamoja na ndugu za baba yao, wachukue urithi wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha waambie Waisraeli kwamba mtu yeyote akifa bila kuacha mtoto wa kiume, urithi wake atapewa binti yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikiwa hana binti, basi urithi huo watapewa ndugu zake wa kiume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ikiwa hana ndugu wa kiume, basi urithi wake utawaendea baba zake, wakubwa na wadogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ikiwa baba yake hana ndugu wa kiume, basi urithi wake utakuwa wa jamaa yake wa karibu, naye ataumiliki kama mali yake. Hii itakuwa kanuni na sheria kwa Waisraeli, kama vile mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu nilivyokuamuru.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
